    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/extras/86698b7f163da9b78f044be4b48273fa.poster.avif?t=1741892665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/extras/86698b7f163da9b78f044be4b48273fa.webm?t=1741892665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Purify negativity from the afterlife and bring together the children of fate! Swear oaths with divine animals and wield powerful twilight abilities in this anime inspired roguelite adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle through the afterlife</h2> Take down enemies while balancing the powers of blessings and curses. The more foes you defeat, the more chances you get to sync your soul with remnants of the fallen. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/extras/cc25361f6adbb349ebeb757cbbf91ec6.poster.avif?t=1741892665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/extras/cc25361f6adbb349ebeb757cbbf91ec6.webm?t=1741892665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Repair broken relationships </h2>Experience an Isekai story like never before! A dispute across the ages has finally reached a tipping point and it's up to you to rekindle the relationship of children with over a million years worth of issues.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Befriend Divine Beasts</h2>Every new choice offers a chance to receive new abilities to improve every run! Earn permanent upgrades to equip at the start of each run, but only after swearing your loyalty to a divine beast.",
